        "snippet": "Insider Purchase: Chief Financial Officer of $GRML Buys 1,400,000 Shares | Quiver Quantitative\n\n# Insider Purchase: Chief Financial Officer of $GRML Buys 1,400,000 Shares\n\nJeff LeBlanc, the Chief Financial Officer of$GRML, bought 1,400,000 shares of the company on 07-16-2026 for an estimated $245,280. This trade was reported by Quiver Quantitative using data from a recent SEC filing. This increased their holdings of this class of stock by approximately 40.9%. Following this trade, they now own 4,820,342 shares of this class of $GRML stock.\n\n## $GRML Insider Trading Activity\n\n$GRML insiders have traded $GRML stock on the open market 2 times in the past 6 months. Of those trades, 1 have been purchases and 1 have been sales.\n\nHere’s a breakdown of recent trading of $GRML stock by insiders over the last 6 months:\n\n- JEFF LEBLANC (Chief Financial Officer) purchased 1,400,000 shares for an estimated $245,280\n- RIAD HUSSEIN EL-DADA sold 175,000 shares for an estimated $40,547\n\nTo track inside",
